      "summaryZh": "Anthropic 更新了 Claude Fable 5 的生物安全防护机制，将生物相关查询的\"回退\"次数减少约 85%，用户在日常健康与教育问题上将更少遇到系统切换至较弱模型的情况。此次更新扩大了模型可协助的生物任务范围，但涉及双重用途的病毒学、毒理学和分子设计请求仍会回退至 Opus 5。Anthropic 表示正通过可信访问途径，致力于缩小专业生物研究与药物开发领域的差距。",
      "summaryEn": "Anthropic has updated the biosecurity guardrails for Claude Fable 5, reducing the number of 'fallbacks' for biology-related queries by approximately 85%, so users will less frequently encounter the system switching to a weaker model on everyday health and education questions. The update expands the range of biological tasks the model can assist with, but requests involving dual-use virology, toxicology, and molecular design still fall back to Opus 5. Anthropic says it is working to close the gap in specialized biological research and drug development through trusted access.",
